msgstr "INTERACTIVE AMIGA/ATARI ST FLOW IS NOT YET RECOVERED."
msgid "NO SYNTHETIC SCREEN OR STATE WILL RUN FOR THIS PLATFORM."
msgstr "NO SYNTHETIC SCREEN OR STATE WILL RUN FOR THIS PLATFORM."
